{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19193","headline":"酬令狐相公见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才兼文武播雄名，遗爱芳尘满洛城。\n身在行台爲仆射，书来甪里访先生。\n闲游占得嵩山色，醉卧高听洛水声。\n千里相思难命驾，七言诗里寄深情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}